  {
   "id": "full-stride-382991@01.020",
   "gameId": "full-stride-382991",
   "displayName": "Update 01.020",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-09-05T11:11:36.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "【Update Information】",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update focuses on improving multiplayer flow and reducing the impact of network latency, along with the following fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "■ Multiplayer Improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Matches will now automatically proceed once two or more players have joined",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・The Results screen will now automatically proceed after a set amount of time, even if the host does not make an input",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・To help reduce the impact of network latency, repeated Start button inputs from clients will now be accepted while horses are still inside the starting gates",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you are experiencing noticeable lag, repeatedly pressing the Start button before the gates open can help reduce its impact: ・A notification dialog will now appear when another player joins a multiplayer session: ■ Bug Fixes: ・Fixed an issue where players could become unable to exit the post-race replay without first entering Photo Mode: ・Fixed an issue where multiplayer information was not properly reset after joining a multiplayer session as a guest: ・Fixed the ranking display when a dead heat occurs: Please update the game to the latest version once the update is available.: You can check the current version number from the Options menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
